      "judgment_rationale": "UserList owns tenant members and pending invitations; invitation acceptance remains a separate route-only capability. Desktop Cloud membership reads and invitation, role-change and removal mutations now resolve through the declared tenant-governance V2 service under a tenant operation lease. The projection re-observes membership for every mutation, preserves role-aware permission checks and uses the vault-bound Cloud transport. Its authority observation still does not publish an authorityRevision, so workbenchCapabilityClient closes the snapshot to capability_authority_revision_unavailable and advertises no Cloud action. Local rejects before transport and remains deliberately not applicable because it must not invent multi-user governance."
